{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52090","headline":"五言咏棋（二首） 二 · 太宗皇帝李世民","name":"五言咏棋（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"治兵期制胜，裂地不要勳。\n半死围中断，全生节外分。\n鴈行非假翼，阵气本无云。\n翫此孙吴意，怡神静俗氛。\n（同前）（按：以上三首，张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}